# Public engine repo — NO assets ever, no build artifacts.

# ── Rust / Cargo ──
/target
**/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# ── Nix / direnv ──
.direnv/
.envrc.local
result
result-*

# ── Editor / OS ──
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# ── Fuzzing (bolero libfuzzer corpus / crashes) ──
**/__fuzz__/

# ── Profiling / coverage ──
flamegraph.svg
perf.data*
*.profraw
*.profdata
/coverage
heaptrack.*

# ── ASSETS: forbidden in engine repos. Belt-and-suspenders refusal. ──
**/assets/
*.glb
*.gltf
*.bin
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.ktx2
*.basis
*.dds
*.hdr
*.exr
*.wav
*.ogg
*.mp3
*.flac
*.mp4
*.webm
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2
*.wasm

# The bench guest resolves against whichever SDK the build sees (public git or a
# patched local checkout); pinning either would be wrong for the other.
modloader/benches/guest/Cargo.lock
